Package: imply
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-06
Title: Efficiently Apply Functions to Images
Authors@R: c(person("Jon", "Clayden", role=c("cre","aut"),
    email="code@clayden.org", comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-6608-0619")))
Description: Infrastructure for manipulating image data in a broad sense,
	including parallelisation. Supports two and three dimensional intensity-based
	image objects, image space embedded time series, vector fields and so on.
